const beliefs=[['Problem before technology.','Start with what needs solving—not what technology happens to be fashionable.'],['Depth before assumptions.','The better we understand a problem, the better we can understand what deserves to be built.'],['Build to learn.','Ideas become useful when they meet reality.'],['Outcomes over outputs.','What changes matters more than what we produce.'],['Stay curious.',"The next important problem may come from somewhere we didn't expect."]];
---
<div class="co">
<section class="co-section co-hero"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">THE COMPANY</p><h1>Built to solve<br/><em>what matters.</em></h1><p>E Deviser is a problem-solving company built around a simple belief: important problems deserve the curiosity, depth, and determination to find better ways forward.</p></div><div class="co-studio" role="img" aria-label="A considered workspace representing people coming together to solve difficult problems"><div class="co-window"></div><div class="co-screen">E DEVİSER<i></i></div><span>A COMPANY BUILT AROUND THE WORK.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="co-section co-alt" id="founder"><div class="co-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">FOUNDED BY</p><div class="co-grid co-founder"><div class="co-mark"><b>E<span>.</span></b><small>CURIOSITY IN MOTION</small><i></i></div><div><small>FOUNDER &amp; CEO</small><h2>Understanding is only the beginning.</h2><p>E Deviser began with a simple conviction: when a problem matters, understanding it deeply is only the beginning. We should be willing to build, test, learn, and keep going until we find something that works.</p><p>That conviction continues to shape how we build the company today.</p><a href="#founder">Read the founder's story →</a><small class="co-note">Founder name, portrait, and full biography will be added once approved.</small></div></div></div></section>
<section class="co-section" id="why"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">WHY E DEVİSER EXISTS</p><h2>Because some problems are <em>worth going deeper for.</em></h2></div><div class="co-copy"><p>We started E Deviser to build—not simply advise, observe, or wait for someone else to solve the difficult problems we care about.</p><p>We believe meaningful progress comes from getting close to the problem, understanding what makes it difficult, bringing the right people and capabilities together, and having the courage to build something new.</p></div></div><div class="co-wrap co-statement"><small>OUR REASON TO BUILD</small><strong>Get close to the problem.<br/>Bring the right capabilities.<br/><em>Make progress real.</em></strong></div></section>
<section class="co-section co-alt" id="beliefs"><div class="co-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">OUR BELIEFS</p><div class="co-grid"><h2>Principles that shape <em>the work.</em></h2><p class="co-copy">These are not slogans for the wall. They are the questions we return to when deciding what deserves our time, attention, and effort.</p></div><div class="co-beliefs">{beliefs.map((b,i)=><article><small>0{i+1}</small><div><h3>{b[0]}</h3><p>{b[1]}</p></div><b>↗</b></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="co-section" id="leadership"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">SENIOR LEADERSHIP</p><h2>Built by people who care deeply about the problems they take on.</h2></div><div class="co-copy"><p>Our leadership brings together the experience, perspective, and determination needed to turn difficult ideas into real work.</p><p class="co-note">Only confirmed executives will be featured. Names, roles, and biographies will be added after approval—no invented profiles.</p></div></div><div class="co-wrap co-rule"><span>PEOPLE</span><i></i><span>PERSPECTIVE</span><i></i><span>DETERMINATION</span></div></section>
<section class="co-section co-alt" id="culture"><div class="co-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">OUR CULTURE</p><div class="co-grid"><h2>Curious enough to question.<br/><em>Practical enough to build.</em></h2><div class="co-copy"><p>We challenge assumptions, get close to the details, and stay open to changing our minds when the evidence tells us to.</p><p>We value people who can move between ideas and execution—people who don't just ask what is possible, but what is worth doing.</p></div></div><div class="co-rule"><span>ASK BETTER QUESTIONS</span><i></i><span>TEST IN THE REAL WORLD</span><i></i><span>LEARN AND IMPROVE</span></div></div></section>
<section class="co-section" id="future"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">LOOKING AHEAD</p><h2>Small enough to stay curious.<br/><em>Ambitious enough to matter.</em></h2></div><div class="co-copy"><p>E Deviser is still early. That's intentional.</p><p>We are building a company capable of going deep on difficult problems, developing new capabilities along the way, and carrying what we learn from one challenge into the next.</p><p>The company may evolve. The problems we work on may change. The technologies will certainly change.</p><strong>Our willingness to build will not.</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="co-section co-alt" id="today"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">WHERE WE ARE NOW</p><h2>Going deep on <em>learning.</em></h2><p class="co-copy">Education is where we are currently applying our approach most deeply—because learning is consequential, complex, measurable, and capable of affecting millions of lives.</p><p class="co-copy">Cuevo is the first major expression of that commitment.</p><a href="/cuevo/">Explore Cuevo ↗</a></div><a class="co-cuevo" href="/cuevo/"><small>OUR FIRST MAJOR EXPRESSION</small><b>CUEVO</b><span>INTELLIGENCE FOR LEARNING</span><i>↗</i></a></div></section>
<section class="co-section" id="team"><div class="co-wrap co-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE WORK</p><h2>A team built around curiosity, ownership, and execution.</h2></div><div class="co-copy"><p>Different perspectives. Different disciplines. One shared expectation: if something matters, we should be willing to do the work to make it better.</p><a href="/company/team/">Meet the team →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="co-section co-close"><div class="co-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">STILL BUILDING</p><small>STILL BUILDING.</small><h2>The problems will change.<br/><em>The ambition won't.</em></h2><p>We are building E Deviser for the long term—one important problem, one real solution, and one lesson at a time.</p><a href="/company/careers-contact/">Talk to E Deviser →</a></div></section>
</div>
